flowchart TD
    Start([Request Arrives]) --> ExtractCookie{Session Cookie<br/>Present?}

    ExtractCookie -->|No| Unauthorized[Return 401 Unauthorized]
    ExtractCookie -->|Yes| QuerySession[Query Session by Token]

    QuerySession --> SessionExists{Session<br/>Found?}

    SessionExists -->|No| Unauthorized
    SessionExists -->|Yes| CheckExpiry{Session<br/>Expired?}

    CheckExpiry -->|Yes| CleanupSession[Delete Expired Session]
    CleanupSession --> Unauthorized

    CheckExpiry -->|No| LoadUser[Load User Data]
    LoadUser --> LoadOrg{Active Org<br/>Set?}

    LoadOrg -->|No| RequireOrg[Require Org Selection]
    LoadOrg -->|Yes| ValidateOrgMember{User Member<br/>of Org?}

    ValidateOrgMember -->|No| ClearActiveOrg[Clear Active Org from Session]
    ClearActiveOrg --> RequireOrg

    ValidateOrgMember -->|Yes| BuildContext[Build Session Context]

    BuildContext --> SessionContext["Session Context Object<br/>───────────────<br/>• userId<br/>• email<br/>• name<br/>• organizationId<br/>• organizationSlug<br/>• role in organization<br/>• available workspaces<br/>• session metadata"]

    SessionContext --> TokenNeeded{API Call Needs<br/>OAuth Token?}

    TokenNeeded -->|No| AuthorizedRequest[Process Request]
    TokenNeeded -->|Yes| DetermineTokenType{Token Type?}

    DetermineTokenType -->|Account Token| LoadAccountToken[Load Account OAuth Token]
    DetermineTokenType -->|Workspace Token| LoadWorkspaceToken[Load Workspace OAuth Token]

    LoadAccountToken --> CheckAccountToken{Account<br/>Exists?}
    LoadWorkspaceToken --> CheckWorkspaceToken{Workspace Account<br/>for Org Exists?}

    CheckAccountToken -->|No| NoAccountError[Error: No Account OAuth]
    CheckWorkspaceToken -->|No| NoWorkspaceError[Error: No Workspace OAuth]

    CheckAccountToken -->|Yes| DecryptAccountToken[Decrypt Account Token]
    CheckWorkspaceToken -->|Yes| DecryptWorkspaceToken[Decrypt Workspace Token]

    DecryptAccountToken --> ValidateAccountToken{Token<br/>Expired?}
    DecryptWorkspaceToken --> ValidateWorkspaceToken{Token<br/>Expired?}

    ValidateAccountToken -->|Yes| RefreshAccountToken[Refresh Account Token]
    ValidateWorkspaceToken -->|Yes| RefreshWorkspaceToken[Refresh Workspace Token]

    RefreshAccountToken --> RefreshAccountSuccess{Refresh<br/>Success?}
    RefreshWorkspaceToken --> RefreshWorkspaceSuccess{Refresh<br/>Success?}

    RefreshAccountSuccess -->|No| ReauthRequired[Require Re-authentication]
    RefreshWorkspaceSuccess -->|No| ReauthRequired

    RefreshAccountSuccess -->|Yes| UpdateAccountToken[Update Encrypted Token in DB]
    RefreshWorkspaceSuccess -->|Yes| UpdateWorkspaceToken[Update Encrypted Token in DB]

    ValidateAccountToken -->|No| UseAccountToken[Use Access Token]
    ValidateWorkspaceToken -->|No| UseWorkspaceToken[Use Access Token]

    UpdateAccountToken --> UseAccountToken
    UpdateWorkspaceToken --> UseWorkspaceToken

    UseAccountToken --> AuthorizedRequest
    UseWorkspaceToken --> AuthorizedRequest

    AuthorizedRequest --> UpdateActivity[Update Session Activity]
    UpdateActivity --> Success([Return Response])

    RequireOrg --> OrgSelectionRequired([Redirect to Org Selector])
    NoAccountError --> ErrorResponse([Error Response])
    NoWorkspaceError --> ErrorResponse
    ReauthRequired --> Unauthorized
    Unauthorized --> UnauthorizedResponse([401 Response])

    style Start fill:#e1f5e1
    style Success fill:#e1f5e1
    style SessionContext fill:#fff4e1
    style Unauthorized fill:#ffe1e1
    style ReauthRequired fill:#ffe1e1
    style DecryptAccountToken fill:#e1e5ff
    style DecryptWorkspaceToken fill:#e1e5ff
